  unitName: Goddess Eir (EU)
  unitId: 730115
  unitNumber: 7028
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Eir has now decided to join
    the war. No longer just a healer, she can now grow monstuous seeds to devour
    the unfortunate souls who might dare enter their woods.
